{"v":1,"accession":"PRJNA1521513","title":"Next-generation sequencing-based approaches for biodetection in complex environments","description":"Generalizable, data-driven approaches are needed to quantify the performance of metagenomic workflows and enable high-confidence decision-making. Here, we generate a well-characterized matrix of experimental samples, parameterizing variables such as biological target type and quantity, and background composition and complexity. Genomic DNA from Bacillus anthracis str Sterne, Bacillus thuringiensis, and/or human adenovirus 40 strain Dugan was added to nucleic acid extracted from aerosol and tissue backgrounds in a range of defined concentrations. Samples were sequenced on both Illumina and ONT platforms.","center":"MIT Lincoln Laboratory","data_type":"Raw sequence reads","submission_date":"2026/08/31 00:00","sample_cols":["accession","title","tier","context","collection_date","collection_year","country","region","place_id","place","location_status","lat","lon","submitted_location","isolation_source","env_broad_scale","env_local_scale","env_medium","eligibility_reason"],"samples":[["SAMN62802809","Aerosol DNA + Bacillus thuringiensis DNA spike 1e4 copies/ul","confirmed_urban","air_dust","2024-12-12",2024,"US","Massachusetts",4930956,"Boston","probable",42.4589,-71.2675,"USA: Massachusetts","urban aerosol",null,null,null,"explicit urban setting at sample level"],["SAMN62802810","Aerosol DNA + Bacillus thuringiensis DNA spike 1e3 copies/ul","confirmed_urban","air_dust","2024-12-12",2024,"US","Massachusetts",4930956,"Boston","probable",42.4589,-71.2675,"USA: Massachusetts","urban aerosol",null,null,null,"explicit urban setting at sample level"],["SAMN62802811","Aerosol DNA + Bacillus thuringiensis DNA spike 1e2 copies/ul","confirmed_urban","air_dust","2024-12-12",2024,"US","Massachusetts",4930956,"Boston","probable",42.4589,-71.2675,"USA: Massachusetts","urban aerosol",null,null,null,"explicit urban setting at sample level"],["SA